{"version":1,"content":"<p>由韓星鄭容和與洪承希主演的Viu Original喜劇《不著邊際的你》日前首播，劇集講述「一吻即暈」的頂級明星，與堅信自己是劇中女主角的古怪女子，展開一段的荒唐愛情故事，首播後引發網民熱烈討論。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:02:02.123540+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T12:28:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T04:58:26.084532+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:58:21.254678+00:00","content_hash":"c6e34dd7bb775a6885338ed1c6068269f6d1842e053e5c03d36609c424c18b3f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}